{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19103","headline":"谢寺双桧 · 刘禹锡","name":"谢寺双桧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双桧苍然古貌奇，含烟吐雾郁参差。\n晚依禅客当金殿，初对将军映画旗。\n龙象界中成宝盖，鸳鸯瓦上出高枝。\n长明灯是前朝焰，曾照青青年少时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19103.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19103","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}